  id: mi_xao_kimchi_thit_heo
  recipeName: "M\xEC X\xE0o Kim Chi Th\u1ECBt Heo"
  region: "H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c"
  basePrice: 125
  dishDescription: "M\xEC x\xE0o cay n\u1ED3ng v\u1EDBi th\u1ECBt heo n\u01B0\u1EDBng than hoa, kim chi c\u1EA3i th\u1EA3o gi\xF2n s\u1EA7n s\u1EADt v\xE0 x\u1ED1t t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u1EADm v\u1ECB."
  culturalStory: "M\xF3n \u0103n khuya ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn b\u1EADc nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a gi\u1EDBi tr\u1EBB H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c, th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u01B0\u1EDFng th\u1EE9c t\u1EA1i c\xE1c qu\xE1n l\u1EC1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng Pojangmacha trong nh\u1EEFng \u0111\xEAm tuy\u1EBFt r\u01A1i."
  flavorProfile: "Chua cay s\u1EA3ng kho\xE1i, th\u1ECBt heo ng\u1ECDt b\xE9o, s\u1EE3i m\xEC dai ngon ng\u1EA5m x\u1ED1t"
  chefTip: "N\u01B0\u1EDBng th\u1ECBt heo x\xE9m c\u1EA1nh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi tr\u1ED9n c\xF9ng m\xEC v\xE0 kim chi \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EADt d\u1EADy m\xF9i kh\xF3i than hoa"
